{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7670550578031888646","title":"【27届校招】流程运营校招生","description":"1.负责团队所涉及业务的质量、效率、成本目标的达成，根据阶段性目标制定工作计划，过程中把控团队的进程、并及时指导及带领团队完成高质量的交付\n2.梳理内外环节对接流程，高效解决内外部门配合，与外环节建立良好联系并作为沟通窗口及时沟通问题解决问题，定期交流反馈\n3.承接业务团队提需，评估反馈后进行推进，满足业务合理需求\n4.对团队不同岗位人员进行培养及行为纪律的管理，负责对团队所涉及生产场地及办公场所的7S管理\n5.代表团队在各仓进行与行政侧的沟通，包括但不限于如行政维保、保安、保洁等相关事宜，确保常规运营维护工作的顺利开展。","requirement":"1.2027届校招生，本科及以上学历，物流类、供应链类、交通类专业优先\n2.良好的理解、语言表达和沟通协调能力，个人沟通能力突出。","recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1785939602225,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7672273040969976105","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届秋招-商品研究中心专项","i18n":"2027届秋招-商品研究中心专项"},"active_status":1},"job_function":{"id":"7287149696757008701","name":"商品研究中心","i18n_name":"商品研究中心"},"job_id":"7670550578037573931","city_list":[{"code":"CT_125","name":"上海","en_name":"Shanghai","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"上海","py_name":"shanghai","mdm_code":"MDCY00000002","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_125","name":"上海","en_name":"Shanghai","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"上海","py_name":"shanghai","mdm_code":"MDCY00000002","node_status":1}],"tag_list":[],"storefront_mode":1,"storefront_list":[],"process_type":2},"recommend_job_post_List":[]},"mess